+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#62805"
+msgid "LUT for HDR on this display"
+msgstr ""
+
+#. Hades: help of setting "videoscreen.hadeslut3dhdr"; translated in Estuary (#54806)
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#62806"
+msgid "The 3D LUT for HDR pictures on the display that Kodi shows on now: a .cube, a .3dl or a .3dlut file made for HDR10 (PQ in BT.2020), with the display in the mode in which it does not map the picture itself (as with HGIG): the mode that the pictures adapted to it and Dolby Vision Low-Latency go out in. A file that says it is made for SDR is not applied. To take it away, select it and press the delete key, or turn the 3D LUT off."
+msgstr ""
+
+#. Hades: label of setting "videoscreen.hadeslut3drange"; translated in Estuary (#54807)
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#62807"
+msgid "Range of a .cube or .3dl LUT"
