+#. Hades: the 3D LUT in the player information: why it is not applied; translated in Estuary (#54814)
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#62814"
+msgid "not applied: TV-led Dolby Vision"
+msgstr ""
+
+#. Hades: the 3D LUT in the player information: why it is not applied; translated in Estuary (#54815)
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#62815"
+msgid "not applied: the display maps it"
+msgstr ""
+
+#. Hades: the 3D LUT in the player information: why it is not applied; translated in Estuary (#54816)
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#62816"
+msgid "not applied: drawn by Kodi"
+msgstr ""
+
+#. Hades: the 3D LUT in the player information: why it is not applied; translated in Estuary (#54817)
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#62817"
+msgid "not applied: for other pictures"
+msgstr ""
+
+#. Hades: the 3D LUT in the player information: why it is not applied; translated in Estuary (#54818)
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#62818"
+msgid "not applied: file not readable"
+msgstr ""
+
+#. Hades: the 3D LUT in the player information: why it is not applied; translated in Estuary (#54819)
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#62819"
+msgid "not applied: fails on this GPU"
